#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ptp-interface.md:2
msgid "ptp interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ptp-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `ptp` interface allows access to the Precision Time Protocol (PTP) "
"[Hardware Clock subsystem](https://www.kernel.org/doc/Documentation/ptp/"
"ptp.txt) in the Linux kernel, enabling the clock to be synced to sub-100 "
"nanoseconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/ptp-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface is primarily intended to be used with {ref}`Ubuntu Core <ref-"
"glossary_ubuntu-core>`."
msgstr ""

